# opencode installs the tool's own dependency into this directory the first time it loads
# `tools/stage_eval.ts`, and writes a lockfile beside it. Those are machine-local; the
# `package.json` that *declares* the dependency is not, so it stays tracked — a fresh clone
# has to say which version of `@opencode-ai/plugin` the tool is written against.
node_modules
package-lock.json
bun.lock
